# API contract

Server routes are the source of truth. Change a route and `client/src/constants/apiEndpoints.js` together. Hooks and `*Api.js` import those constants — do not hardcode `/api/...`.

Non-REST paths (do not invent the REST equivalents):

- Create blog: `POST /api/blog/add` multipart (`blog` JSON string + `image`)
- Delete blog: `POST /api/blog/delete` `{ id }`
- Publish / unpublish: `POST /api/blog/publish` and `/unpublish` `{ id }` — not `toggle-publish`
- Dashboard: `GET /api/admin/dashboard` — not `/api/admin/stats`
- No `PUT` or `DELETE /api/blog/:id`
